From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mihawk <163614687+mihawk-99@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 02 Nov 2026 20:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] wine.inf: PS5: The 2010, 2012 and 2013 C++ runtimes are recorded as installed, at the builtins' versions.

Launchers and game installers ask whether a Visual C++ redistributable is installed before they start a game, and offer
to install it when the answer is no, although Wine's builtins already provide the runtime. Wine records the 2015-2022
runtime (VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes, 14.42.34433, the version its msvcp140 reports) for x64 and x86 in both registry
views. The 2013, 2012 and 2010 runtimes are now recorded the way their redistributables record them, in the same
sections and so in the same views (the 64-bit view gets x64, the 32-bit view x64 and x86, as on 64-bit Windows):
- 2013: VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\{x64,x86}, Installed 1, version 12.0.40664 (msvcr120's own version);
- 2012: VisualStudio\11.0\VC\Runtimes\{x64,x86}, Installed 1, major 11 minor 0 (msvcr110 carries no build number, so
  none is claimed);
- 2010: VisualStudio\10.0\VC\VCRedist\{x64,x86}, Installed 1, version v10.0.30319 (msvcr100's own version).
Only the C and C++ runtimes are claimed: Wine has no MFC builtins for these years. 2005 and 2008 are Wine's WinSxS
assemblies already. An existing prefix gets the records when it next updates (wine.inf changed). Not run on a console.
---
diff --git a/loader/wine.inf.in b/loader/wine.inf.in
index 575d120..28a7ef1 100644
--- a/loader/wine.inf.in
+++ b/loader/wine.inf.in
@@ -720,6 +720,19 @@ HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Major",0x10003,0x0000
 HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Minor",0x10003,0x0000002a
 HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Rbld",0x10003,0x00000000
 HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Version",2,"14.42.34433.0"
+; PS5: the 2010, 2012 and 2013 runtimes as their redistributables record them, at the builtins' own versions
+; (msvcr100 10.0.30319, msvcr120 12.0.40664; msvcr110 carries no build), so a program that checks finds them.
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Bld",0x10003,0x00009ed8
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Installed",0x10003,0x00000001
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Major",0x10003,0x0000000c
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Minor",0x10003,0x00000000
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Rbld",0x10003,0x00000000
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Version",2,"v12.0.40664.00"
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\11.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Installed",0x10003,0x00000001
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\11.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Major",0x10003,0x0000000b
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\11.0\VC\Runtimes\x64,"Minor",0x10003,0x00000000
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\10.0\VC\VCRedist\x64,"Installed",0x10003,0x00000001
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\10.0\VC\VCRedist\x64,"Version",2,"v10.0.30319"
 
 [VCRuntime.ntarm64]
 HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\arm64,"Bld",0x10003,0x00008681
@@ -736,6 +749,19 @@ HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Major",0x10003,0x0000
 HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Minor",0x10003,0x0000002a
 HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Rbld",0x10003,0x00000000
 HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\14.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Version",2,"14.42.34433.0"
+; PS5: the 2010, 2012 and 2013 runtimes as their redistributables record them, at the builtins' own versions
+; (msvcr100 10.0.30319, msvcr120 12.0.40664; msvcr110 carries no build), so a program that checks finds them.
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Bld",0x10003,0x00009ed8
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Installed",0x10003,0x00000001
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Major",0x10003,0x0000000c
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Minor",0x10003,0x00000000
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Rbld",0x10003,0x00000000
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\12.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Version",2,"v12.0.40664.00"
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\11.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Installed",0x10003,0x00000001
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\11.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Major",0x10003,0x0000000b
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\11.0\VC\Runtimes\x86,"Minor",0x10003,0x00000000
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\10.0\VC\VCRedist\x86,"Installed",0x10003,0x00000001
+HKLM,SOFTWARE\Microsoft\VisualStudio\10.0\VC\VCRedist\x86,"Version",2,"v10.0.30319"
 
 [RegisterDllsSection]
 ;;some dlls have to be registered first
